  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c2a67ba2-d228-4981-b68f-23f3e3517273.png\" width=\"863\" height=\"222\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><em><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>必須安裝以下所有模組：</strong></span></em></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons</a> <span style=\"color:#eccafa\">(<a style=\"color:#eccafa\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sbom_xela\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>sbom_xela</span></a>)</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_05b0c02b-7784-46c4-a51f-e6c21d926b22.png\"></a></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry</a> <span style=\"color:#eccafa\">(<a style=\"color:#eccafa\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/obliviousspartan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>ObliviousSpartan</span></a>)</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_39a19969-bfdd-4510-9eeb-e03924491215.png\"></a></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-ice-and-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Weaponry: Ice and Fire</a> <span style=\"color:#eccafa\">(<a style=\"color:#eccafa\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kreloxcz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span>kreloxcz</span></a>)</span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry-ice-and-fire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_084eb33d-f354-484d-8003-c210a787bb0e.png\"></a></span><br></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>本模組為 <strong>Spartan Weaponry</strong> 與 <strong>Ice and Fire&nbsp;</strong>兩種模組新增了多種實用物品與功能，略微擴充並調整了它們的內容與相容性！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h4><br><strong>本模組目前<em>新增</em>以下內容：</strong><br>龍骨重弩弩箭 + 附效變體</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c0a2829f-47ab-4c45-bcfb-b7ed7cc7d6d5.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h4><br><strong>本模組目前<em>修改</em>以下內容：<br></strong></h4>\n<h4>火焰龍骨 + 龍鋼能力</h4>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9d4d929b-89f2-44e7-8854-a11937436fd3.gif\" width=\"465\" height=\"240\"></h4>\n<h4><br>雷電龍骨 + 龍鋼能力</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_76ff2537-ca29-4c87-9252-591798eb0134.gif\" width=\"465\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p>這些功能可在&nbsp;<strong>spartanfireextras-common.toml</strong> 檔案中進行自訂設定！<br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br><em>未來可能的更新計畫：<br>- 冰／火／雷電龍骨箭<br>- 冰／火／雷電龍骨弩箭<br>- 冰／火／雷電龍鋼箭<br>- 冰／火／雷電龍鋼弩箭</em><br>- 斯廷法利斯弩箭<br>- 水怪弩箭<br>- 潮汐弩箭<br>- 九頭蛇弩箭<br><br></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
